#! seed 1861
# Civil War Strategy: the commands of the main menu as the Union (QB64Rust's tools/screen/README.md,
# "Places and rules"). In March 1861: a recruit; a move, cancelled; each entry of COMMANDS (Cancel twice, Fortify,
# Army Drill, Relieve, Supply and Join with nothing to do; Detach and Capital are "-" for the Union this month); each
# report of Inform; two ships built and sailed to Baltimore; a railroad move. In May 1861 the ships land an army
# at Baltimore (Invasion). Then END TURN by rules to the game's end, the Hall of Fame, Game Over and Quit.

# The waits of the computer's turns: a space each; a Retreat menu: the city it starts on; a main menu: END TURN;
# the End Turn and End Game menus: Yes; the Options at the end: Quit this Game.
rule 1:R key space
rule 1:P key space
rule 1:B key space
rule 1:U key space
rule 1:K key space
rule 1:I key space
rule 1:N key space
rule 1:S key space
rule 1:H key space
rule 1:G key space
rule 1:F key space
rule 1:L key space
rule 2:M text e
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter
rule 2:O text q

# The title menu: Start NEW Game.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
# March 1861. Troops: recruit at the first city, out.
play until 2:M
digest
text t
prompt
key enter
prompt
key esc
# Moves: McClellan from Cincinnati to the first city.
prompt
text m
prompt
key enter
prompt
key enter
# COMMANDS: Cancel that move; Cancel again (no orders left); Fortify the first city; Army Drill the first army;
# Relieve the first army's leader with the first new one; Supply (all have supplies: to the main menu).
prompt
text c
prompt
digest
text c
prompt
key enter
prompt
text c
prompt
text f
prompt
key enter
prompt
text a
prompt
key enter
prompt
text r
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
key enter
prompt
text s
# COMMANDS: Join (no two armies in one city: to the main menu).
prompt
text c
prompt
text j
# Inform: each report, a key after each.
prompt
text i
prompt
text u
prompt
digest
key space
prompt
text i
prompt
text r
prompt
key space
prompt
text i
prompt
text c
prompt
key space
prompt
text i
prompt
text f
prompt
digest
key space
prompt
text i
prompt
text i
prompt
digest
key space
prompt
text i
prompt
text b
prompt
key space
# Ships: build two, sail to Baltimore, the first port.
prompt
text s
prompt
text b
prompt
text b
prompt
text s
prompt
digest
key enter
# Railroad: from Cincinnati, to the next city of the picker.
prompt
text r
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
state
key enter
# END TURN, Yes.
prompt
text e
prompt
text y
# May 1861. Ships: Invasion at Baltimore.
play until 2:M
digest
text s
prompt
digest
text i
# Four more turns: the main menu, END TURN (and Yes by the rule).
repeat 4
play until 2:M
digest
text e
end
# The game's end: End Game (Yes by the rule), the Options: Quit; the Hall of Fame: the commander's name; Game Over;
# the title menu: Quit; END's key.
play until 2:O
state
text q
play until 4
state
text Grant
key enter
play until 2:V
state
text q
repeat space
